    <string name="onboarding_start">Let’s start</string>
    <string name="onboarding_welcome_title">Stop throwing food away</string>
    <string name="onboarding_welcome_text">ShelfLife keeps track of what expires when in your fridge and pantry – and reminds you in time. No sign-up and no servers of our own: we never see your list. Your phone’s own backup keeps it safe, so it isn’t lost when you switch phones.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_scan_title">Scanned in seconds</string>
    <string name="onboarding_scan_text">Tap “Scan products”, show the barcode, then hold the expiry date inside the frame. If the camera can’t read it: “~1 week”, “Later”, or type it in digits (e.g. 2510 = 25 Oct). At the start, choose fridge, freezer or pantry.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_scan_sample_date">BEST BEFORE: 25.10.2026</string>
    <string name="onboarding_quick_title">Without a barcode, too</string>
    <string name="onboarding_quick_text">Bread, eggs, vegetables? One tap with the + button. The expiry is then estimated (~ sign) – you can correct it in the list any time.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_quick_sample_status">~ Expires in 3 days · estimated</string>
    <string name="onboarding_swipe_title">Used up or thrown away?</string>
    <string name="onboarding_swipe_text">Swipe an item left if it’s used up, right if you had to throw it away. For several pieces, “−1” lowers the quantity by one. Made a mistake? “Undo” at the bottom reverts everything.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_swipe_sample_name">Yogurt</string>
    <string name="onboarding_swipe_sample_status">Expires in 2 days · 4 pcs</string>
    <string name="onboarding_swipe_legend_left">← left: used up</string>
    <string name="onboarding_swipe_legend_right">right: thrown away →</string>
    <string name="onboarding_notify_title">We remind you before it expires</string>
    <string name="onboarding_notify_text">We check the list once a day. From the notification you can mark an item as used up with one tap, or ask for a reminder tomorrow. You can change this later with the bell icon.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_notify_enable">Turn on notifications</string>
    <string name="onboarding_notify_enabled">Notifications are on</string>

